@subsection parse.h

@defun parseProgram (CString fileName, CString searchPath, ErrorLog* errorLog) @arrow{} Context*
Search along @code{searchPath} for @code{fileName}.  If found, it
parses it as a DeadEnds script.  If the parse is successful, then it
returns a @code{Program*}, otherwise it returns @code{null}.  If any
errors occurs, they are logged in @code{errorLog}.
@end defun

@section Internal Functions

@subsection parse.h

@deftypevar CString curFileName
@deftypevarx int curLine
The name and line number of the file currently being parsed.

These are maintained during parsing both to improve error messages
during parsing and to be recorded in parse nodes to be used in error
messages should an error occur when the script is running.
@end deftypevar
